#. Tag: action
#: menu-mainwindow.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Menu entry for rotating the currently selected images lossless <menuchoice> "
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"press\">&Ctrl;&Shift;&Left;</keycombo></"
